--- sonar_quality_rules
rule_name | applies_to | pattern | action | exception | priority
readonly_members | All | Non-reassigned properties | Add readonly | Local variables | critical
unused_imports | All | Unimported symbols | Remove import | Active features | critical
lifecycle_interfaces | Components | OnInit without ngOnInit | Remove interface | Actual implementation | high
mock_services | Tests | Test mock objects | Add readonly | Variable scope | high
subscriptions | Components | Subscription objects | Add readonly | Reassigned ones | high
service_injections | All | Dependency injection | Add readonly | Mutable services | high
config_constants | All | Config values | Add readonly | Dynamic configs | medium

--- readonly_members_patterns
pattern_type | pattern | incorrect_example | correct_example | applies_to | verification
Subscriptions | private subscription | private subscription = new Sub() | private readonly subscription = new Sub() | Services/Components | Never reassigned
Mock_Services | private mockService | let mockService = spy() | let readonly mockService = spy() | Tests | Only in class properties
Component_Refs | private component | let component = comp | private readonly component = comp | Tests | Component class only
Configurations | private config | private config = {} | private readonly config = {} | Services | Static configs
Injected_Services | private service | constructor(service) | constructor(private readonly service) | All | Dependency injection
Form_Controls | private control | private form = new FC() | private readonly form = new FC() | Components | If not form.reset()

--- lifecycle_interface_rules
interface | method_required | must_implement | import_when | remove_when | example
OnInit | ngOnInit() | Implementation required | Used | Not implemented | implements OnInit { ngOnInit() {} }
OnDestroy | ngOnDestroy() | Implementation required | Used | Not implemented | implements OnDestroy { ngOnDestroy() {} }
AfterViewInit | ngAfterViewInit() | Implementation required | Used | Not implemented | implements AfterViewInit { ngAfterViewInit() {} }
OnChanges | ngOnChanges() | Implementation required | Used | Not implemented | implements OnChanges { ngOnChanges() {} }
DoCheck | ngDoCheck() | Implementation required | Used | Not implemented | implements DoCheck { ngDoCheck() {} }

--- import_cleanup_checklist
check | verification | action_if_true | action_if_false | priority
OnInit_Present | ngOnInit() method exists | Keep OnInit import | Remove OnInit import | high
OnDestroy_Present | ngOnDestroy() method exists | Keep OnDestroy import | Remove OnDestroy import | high
Service_Injected | Service in constructor | Keep service import | Remove service import | high
Interface_Used | Interface referenced in code | Keep interface import | Remove interface import | high
Utility_Used | Utility function called | Keep import | Remove import | high
Type_Used | Type in annotations | Keep import | Remove import | medium

--- automatic_application_triggers
trigger_event | check_type | applies_to | action | validation
File_Created | Full scan | New TypeScript file | Apply all rules | All checks pass
File_Modified | Incremental | Existing file | Check changed section | Target section clean
Test_Created | Test specific | *.spec.ts file | Apply test patterns | Test structure valid
Component_Created | Component specific | *.component.ts | Apply component rules | Component valid
Service_Created | Service specific | *.service.ts | Apply service rules | Service valid
Lint_Run | Comprehensive | All TypeScript | Full analysis | No violations

--- validation_before_completion
validation | check | tool | pass_criteria | priority
All_Properties | readonly check | sonarqube | Non-reassigned = readonly | critical
No_Unused_Imports | Import scan | eslint | All imports used | critical
Lifecycle_Correct | Interface check | tsc | Implemented if imported | high
No_Syntax_Errors | Compilation | typescript | Code compiles | critical
Types_Correct | Type check | typescript | No type errors | critical
Tests_Pass | Execution | karma | All tests pass | high
